    "Machine-translated first pass, NOT native-speaker verified the way da-dk is - review before considering it 'done'.",
    "'tonne' maps to metric_ton (standard French usage, matches Danish 'ton' pattern).",
    "'livre' is intentionally NOT mapped - like Danish 'pund'/German 'Pfund', French 'livre' historically/colloquially means exactly 500 g, not the imperial pound (453.6 g).",
